2-na-ne-ne agargara id₂-da i-ni-in-/šub\-[bu-uš]
maš-maš-e suḫurku₆ gal a-/ta\ {im-ta-an-[e₃]} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-/ed₃\}
um-ma saĝ-bur-ru [ḫu-ri₂]-in{mušen} a-ta {im-ta-an-[e₃]} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-/ed₃\}
ḫu-ri₂-in{mušen}-e suḫurku₆ gal {in-kar ḫur-saĝ-še₃ ba-[an-kur₉]} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) a-/ĝi₆-a\ in-kar an-na ba-/e\-ed₃}

2-kam-ma-aš agargara id₂-da i-ni-in-šub-bu-uš
maš-maš-e u₈ sila₄-bi a-ta {im-ta-an-[e₃]} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-ed₃}
um-ma saĝ-bur-ru ur-bar-ra a-ta {im-ta-an-[e₃]} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-ed₃}
ur-bar-ra u₈ sila₄{!}-/bi\ in-kar edin daĝal-še₃ ba-an-ur₃

3-kam-ma-aš agargara id₂-da i-ni-in-šub-bu-uš
maš-maš-e ab₂ amar-bi-ta a-ta {im-ta-an-e₃} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-ed₃}
um-ma saĝ-bur-ru ur-maḫ-e a-ta {im-ta-an-e₃} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-ed₃}
ur-maḫ-e ab₂ amar-bi in-kar ĝiš-gi-še₃ {ba-an-kur₉} {(some mss. ḫave instead:) ba-an-ur₃}

4-kam-ma-aš agargara id₂-da i-ni-in-šub-bu-uš
maš-maš-e šeg₉ šeg₉-bar-e a-ta {im-ta-an-e₃} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-ed₃{?}}
um-ma saĝ-bur-ru nemurₓ(PIRIĜ.TUR) ḫur-saĝ-ĝa₂ a-ta {im-ta-an-e₃} {(1 ms. ḫas instead:) im-ta-an-/ed₃\}
nemurₓ(PIRIĜ.TUR)-e šeg₉ šeg₉-bar-e in-kar ḫur-saĝ-še₃ ba-an-kur₉
